		<item>
		<title>Kevlar Air Slide Fabric</title>
		<link>https://filter.philitee.com/?product=kevlar-air-slide-fabric</link>
					<comments>https://filter.philitee.com/?product=kevlar-air-slide-fabric#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[wpdc@20248]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 01:35:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">http://filter.philitee.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3703</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Kevlar air slide fabric is known for its high strength, durability, and heat and chemical resistance. Kevlar is a very popular filter media material with many good properties. However, it is not so popular in air slide cloth because its price is much higher than polyester air slide cloth. But if you need more powerful performance, it is a good choice.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>The max. length per roll</strong>: 50 M.</li>
 	<li><strong>Max Width</strong>: 2.6 M.</li>
 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 4~10 MM.</li>
 	<li><strong>Heat-resistant</strong>: 260 ℃ ~ 280 ℃.</li>
 	<li><strong>Our capacity</strong>: 500 ㎡/ month.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3703" class="elementor elementor-3703" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c150dfd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="c150dfd" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fded556 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="fded556" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
