					<description><![CDATA[Fluidization cloth, also known as aeration cloth or air slide fabric, is a specialized textile used in various industrial processes where dry, powdery materials need to be fluidized or moved using air.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Air Permeability.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>High Tensile Strength.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Heat Resistance.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Wear Resistance.</strong></li>
</ul>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3677" class="elementor elementor-3677" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c7283c1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="c7283c1" data-element_type="container">
