					<description><![CDATA[Polyester air slide fabric is a common industrial conveyor belt commonly used to transport various types of materials and products. It is made of polyester fiber, which has properties such as wear resistance, corrosion resistance, high strength and good stability, so it is very suitable for making conveyor belts.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: 500 ㎡/ month.</li>
 	<li><strong>Max Width</strong>: 2.6 m.</li>
 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 4~10 mm.</li>
 	<li><strong>Heat-resistant</strong>: -160 ℃ ~ 200 ℃.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3665" class="elementor elementor-3665" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-afd2df3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="afd2df3" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-26c851b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="26c851b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Air slide Fabrics are air permeable fabrics used in air activated conveyors or bin/silo aerators for the conveyance of dry bulk powders. It is also be called air slide belt, air slide cloth, air slide canvas, air slide membrane. Polyester conveyor belts can be used in a variety of harsh environmental conditions, including high temperatures, moisture and chemically corrosive environments. Because the polyester conveyor belt material has a low friction coefficient and good wear resistance, it is suitable for conveying large quantities of materials at high speeds.</p>						</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-79a54d6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="79a54d6" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f6ca3bf elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="f6ca3bf" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
