				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-58d94d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="58d94d3" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Our fabrics can be used at temperatures between -60°C and +150°C. The airslide fabrics are made from polyester yarns. We are also, however, able to weave fabrics to our customers’ specific demands for air permeability and mechanical strength.</p><h3>Air Slide System</h3><p>Air slide fabrics use gravity to do most of the work without any moving parts, by tilting the air conveyor to flow the powder material, which flows through the porous media under the influence of low-pressure air. Air slide systems provide high-volume material handling with extremely low energy requirements because only small amounts of low-pressure air are required to move the material.</p>						</div>
				</div>
