<h3>Advantages</h3>
<p>1.One side air permeable and other side PU-coated<br />
2.Good abrasion resistance and long service life<br />
3.All synthetic, lightweight and flexible, easy to coil<br />
4.Ageing and ozone resistant<br />
5.Weather resistant with minimum maintenance</p>
<h3>Features</h3>
<p>One side air permeable, other side PU-coated.<br />
Good abrasion resistance and long service life all synthetic, lightweight and flexible, easy to coil ageing and ozone resistant – weather resistant minimum maintenance.</p>
<h3>Applications</h3>
<p>Our products can be applied to aeration of bulk powders and granular in silos and silo wagons.</p>
