					<description><![CDATA[Cotton conveyor belts are a type of conveyor belt commonly used in various industries for the transportation of bulk materials, goods, or products. These conveyor belts are made from cotton fabric layers and are known for their versatility and durability.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3647" class="elementor elementor-3647" data-elementor-post-type="product">
